msgid "Transpile an LUCJ ansatz {#transpile-an-lucj-ansatz}"
msgstr "Transpilasikan ansatz LUCJ {#transpile-an-lucj-ansatz}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Important\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  The concepts in this guide are only available in the Python API.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Penting\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  Konsep dalam panduan ini hanya tersedia dalam API Python.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The local unitary cluster Jastrow ([LUCJ](https://pubs.rsc.org/en/content/articlelanding/2023/sc/d3sc02516k)) ansatz is a compact, hardware-efficient parametrization of a correlated electronic wavefunction. It is a member of the more general unitary cluster Jastrow (UCJ) family and takes the form\n"
msgstr "Ansatz Jastrow kluster uniter setempat ([LUCJ](https://pubs.rsc.org/en/content/articlelanding/2023/sc/d3sc02516k)) ialah parametrisasi padat yang cekap perkakasan bagi fungsi gelombang elektronik berkorelasi. Ia merupakan ahli keluarga Jastrow kluster uniter (UCJ) yang lebih umum dan mengambil bentuk\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\lvert \\Psi \\rangle = \\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{L} \\mathcal{U}_k\\, e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}\\,\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger\\right) \\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\lvert \\Psi \\rangle = \\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{L} \\mathcal{U}_k\\, e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}\\,\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger\\right) \\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle$ is a reference state (typically Hartree-Fock), each $\\mathcal{U}_k$ is an orbital rotation, and each $\\mathcal{J}_k$ is a diagonal Coulomb operator\n"
msgstr "dengan $\\lvert \\Phi_0 \\rangle$ ialah keadaan rujukan (lazimnya Hartree-Fock), setiap $\\mathcal{U}_k$ ialah putaran orbital, dan setiap $\\mathcal{J}_k$ ialah operator Coulomb pepenjuru\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{J} = \\frac12 \\sum_{ij,\\sigma\\tau} \\mathbf{J}^{\\sigma\\tau}_{ij}\\,\n"
"n_{i\\sigma}\\, n_{j\\tau},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{J} = \\frac12 \\sum_{ij,\\sigma\\tau} \\mathbf{J}^{\\sigma\\tau}_{ij}\\,\n"
"n_{i\\sigma}\\, n_{j\\tau},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "with $n_{i\\sigma}$ the number operator on spatial orbital $i$ with spin $\\sigma$.\n"
msgstr "dengan $n_{i\\sigma}$ ialah operator nombor pada orbital ruang $i$ dengan spin $\\sigma$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) builds the ansatz operator; this package turns it into a circuit and lowers that circuit onto qubits. This guide is about the second half of that sentence. The reason to make the trip is the lowering itself: ffsim’s own Qiskit gates are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation, whereas a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") carries no assumption about its fermion-to-qubit encoding, so the same ansatz can be synthesized through whichever encoding suits the target device.\n"
msgstr "[ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) membina operator ansatz; pakej ini menukarkannya menjadi litar dan menurunkan litar itu ke atas qubit. Panduan ini adalah mengenai separuh kedua ayat tersebut. Sebab untuk membuat perjalanan ini ialah penurunan itu sendiri: gate Qiskit ffsim sendiri khusus untuk transformasi Jordan-Wigner, manakala [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") tidak membawa andaian tentang pengekodan fermion-ke-qubitnya, jadi ansatz yang sama boleh disintesis melalui apa jua pengekodan yang sesuai dengan peranti sasaran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ansatz operator therefore arrives here ready-made, and everything below is what happens to it afterwards: what the gate decomposes into, how it lowers through Jordan-Wigner, how it is matched to a device coupling map, and what a non-Jordan-Wigner lowering would still need. For building, parametrizing, or simulating a UCJ ansatz in the first place, see ffsim’s [own guides](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html).\n"
msgstr "Oleh itu, operator ansatz tiba di sini dalam keadaan siap, dan segala yang berikut ialah apa yang berlaku kepadanya selepas itu: apa yang diuraikan oleh gate, bagaimana ia diturunkan melalui Jordan-Wigner, bagaimana ia dipadankan dengan peta gandingan peranti, dan apa yang masih diperlukan oleh penurunan bukan Jordan-Wigner. Untuk membina, memparametrikan, atau mensimulasikan ansatz UCJ pada mulanya, lihat [panduan sendiri](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) ffsim.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The [ffsim relationship guide](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) for how the two packages divide the work, and the [transpilation guide](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) for the pipeline stages used below.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Lihat juga\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [Panduan hubungan ffsim](ffsim#ffsim-relationship-explanation) tentang cara kedua-dua pakej membahagikan kerja, dan [panduan transpilasi](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) untuk peringkat saluran paip yang digunakan di bawah.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get an LUCJ operator from ffsim {#1-get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim}"
msgstr "1. Dapatkan operator LUCJ daripada ffsim {#1-get-an-lucj-operator-from-ffsim}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ansatz is initialized from the amplitudes of a coupled-cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) calculation. Run restricted Hartree-Fock followed by CCSD for a hydrogen molecule in the `6-31g` basis, using [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/) for the quantum chemistry, then hand the amplitudes to ffsim’s [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"). It performs a *double factorization* of the $t_2$ amplitudes to obtain the per-layer diagonal Coulomb matrices and orbital rotations, and derives an optional final orbital rotation from the $t_1$ amplitudes. The number of repetitions $L$ is whatever that factorization yields; `n_reps` truncates it, trading accuracy for a shallower circuit.\n"
msgstr "Ansatz dimulakan daripada amplitud pengiraan kluster berganding singles dan doubles (CCSD). Jalankan Hartree-Fock terhad diikuti CCSD untuk molekul hidrogen dalam asas `6-31g`, menggunakan [PySCF](https://pyscf.org/) untuk kimia kuantum, kemudian serahkan amplitud kepada [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\") milik ffsim. Ia melakukan *pemfaktoran berganda* ke atas amplitud $t_2$ untuk mendapatkan matriks Coulomb pepenjuru dan putaran orbital bagi setiap lapisan, dan menerbitkan putaran orbital akhir pilihan daripada amplitud $t_1$. Bilangan pengulangan $L$ ialah apa sahaja yang dihasilkan oleh pemfaktoran itu; `n_reps` memotongnya, menukar ketepatan dengan litar yang lebih cetek.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is where the ansatz stops being an ffsim concern. ffsim offers choices here that this package neither sees nor needs to know about, such as the variationally optimized (“compressed”) factorization behind `optimize=True`, or the parameter-vector packing that a variational optimizer drives. All of them produce the same kind of operator, and everything below works unchanged on any of them.\n"
msgstr "Di sinilah ansatz tidak lagi menjadi urusan ffsim. ffsim menawarkan pilihan di sini yang tidak dilihat atau perlu diketahui oleh pakej ini, seperti pemfaktoran (“termampat”) yang dioptimumkan secara variasi di sebalik `optimize=True`, atau pembungkusan vektor parameter yang dipacu oleh pengoptimum variasi. Kesemuanya menghasilkan jenis operator yang sama, dan segala yang berikut berfungsi tanpa perubahan pada mana-mana daripadanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Turn the operator into a fermionic circuit {#2-turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit}"
msgstr "2. Tukarkan operator menjadi litar fermionik {#2-turn-the-operator-into-a-fermionic-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") gate wraps the operator and expresses it as a circuit over *fermionic modes*. The gate is a pure unitary carrying no reference of its own, so prepend an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate (built with [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) to supply the Hartree-Fock reference the ansatz is applied to.\n"
msgstr "Gate [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") membungkus operator dan menyatakannya sebagai litar ke atas *mod fermionik*. Gate ini ialah uniter tulen yang tidak membawa rujukan sendiri, jadi letakkan gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") (dibina dengan [`from_hartree_fock()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes.from_hartree_fock\")) di hadapan untuk membekalkan rujukan Hartree-Fock yang dikenakan ansatz.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Decomposing the circuit reveals its anatomy, and this is the representation the rest of the guide operates on. The [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate prepares the reference determinant, and each ansatz layer contributes an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") $\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger$, then $e^{i\\mathcal{J}_k}$ (an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") of the diagonal Coulomb operator $\\mathcal{J}_k$), then $\\mathcal{U}_k$, with a final [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") at the end. The orbital rotations act per spin sector, so each is placed on the alpha modes `0..norb` and the beta modes `norb..2*norb` independently.\n"
msgstr "Menguraikan litar mendedahkan anatominya, dan ini ialah perwakilan yang diusahakan oleh seluruh baki panduan. Gate [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") menyediakan penentu rujukan, dan setiap lapisan ansatz menyumbang [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") $\\mathcal{U}_k^\\dagger$, kemudian $e^{i\\mathcal{J}_k}$ (sebuah [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") bagi operator Coulomb pepenjuru $\\mathcal{J}_k$), kemudian $\\mathcal{U}_k$, dengan [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") akhir di penghujung. Putaran orbital bertindak bagi setiap sektor spin, jadi setiap satu diletakkan pada mod alfa `0..norb` dan mod beta `norb..2*norb` secara bebas.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The gates that the UCJ ansatz decomposes into.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The gates that the UCJ ansatz decomposes into.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-3.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every gate in that decomposition is still fermionic: [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") and [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") are defined on modes, and no qubit or Pauli operator has appeared yet. That is what leaves the encoding open, and it is the state the ansatz stays in until the synthesis stage picks one.\n"
msgstr "Setiap gate dalam penguraian itu masih fermionik: [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") dan [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") ditakrifkan pada mod, dan tiada operator qubit atau Pauli yang muncul lagi. Itulah yang membiarkan pengekodan terbuka, dan ia ialah keadaan yang kekal pada ansatz sehingga peringkat sintesis memilih satu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Each layer ends with $\\mathcal{U}_k$ and the next begins with $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$, so adjacent [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates could be merged into a single rotation. A transpilation pass performing this fusion is a planned future development.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Nota\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Setiap lapisan berakhir dengan $\\mathcal{U}_k$ dan yang berikutnya bermula dengan $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$, jadi gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") bersebelahan boleh digabungkan menjadi satu putaran. Pas transpilasi yang melakukan pelakuran ini merupakan pembangunan masa depan yang dirancang.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Choose a fermion-to-qubit encoding {#3-choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding}"
msgstr "3. Pilih pengekodan fermion-ke-qubit {#3-choose-a-fermion-to-qubit-encoding}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit is still fermionic, and that is the point at which this package earns its place in the workflow. A [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") carries no assumption about how modes become qubits, so the encoding is a *synthesis-stage* choice rather than something baked into the ansatz. That is what this package adds over ffsim’s own Qiskit gates, which are specific to the Jordan-Wigner transformation.\n"
msgstr "Litar masih fermionik, dan itulah titik di mana pakej ini membuktikan tempatnya dalam aliran kerja. [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") tidak membawa andaian tentang cara mod menjadi qubit, jadi pengekodan ialah pilihan *peringkat sintesis* dan bukan sesuatu yang terterap dalam ansatz. Itulah yang ditambah oleh pakej ini berbanding gate Qiskit ffsim sendiri, yang khusus untuk transformasi Jordan-Wigner.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For Jordan-Wigner alone you would not need this detour: ffsim ships [`UCJOpSpinBalancedJW`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW.html#ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW \"(in ffsim)\") and its siblings, which take a UCJ operator to a qubit circuit on their own. The reason to route the ansatz through a fermionic circuit is everything *else* an encoding can buy you. Local encodings, for instance, spend extra qubits to bound the Pauli weight of each term, which the [1D](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) and [2D](2-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) flow-set guides use to make a Trotter step’s two-qubit depth independent of the system size.\n"
msgstr "Untuk Jordan-Wigner sahaja anda tidak memerlukan lencongan ini: ffsim menyertakan [`UCJOpSpinBalancedJW`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW.html#ffsim.qiskit.UCJOpSpinBalancedJW \"(in ffsim)\") dan saudara-maranya, yang membawa operator UCJ ke litar qubit dengan sendirinya. Sebab untuk menyalurkan ansatz melalui litar fermionik ialah segala yang *lain* yang boleh diberikan oleh pengekodan. Pengekodan setempat, sebagai contoh, membelanjakan qubit tambahan untuk mengikat berat Pauli bagi setiap sebutan, yang digunakan oleh panduan set aliran [1D](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) dan [2D](2-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) untuk menjadikan kedalaman dua-qubit bagi satu langkah Trotter tidak bergantung pada saiz sistem.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a UCJ ansatz specifically, the synthesis stage has to cover two kinds of gate:\n"
msgstr "Khusus untuk ansatz UCJ, peringkat sintesis perlu meliputi dua jenis gate:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The diagonal Coulomb evolution.** [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") is already encoding-agnostic: [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\") takes a mapper function, so the $e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}$ layers lower through any encoding you can express as one. The [flow-set guides](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) show how to write one.\n"
msgstr "**Evolusi Coulomb pepenjuru.** [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") sudah pun tidak bergantung pada pengekodan: [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\") mengambil fungsi pemeta, jadi lapisan $e^{i \\mathcal{J}_k}$ diturunkan melalui mana-mana pengekodan yang boleh anda ungkapkan sebagai satu. [Panduan set aliran](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) menunjukkan cara menulisnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The orbital rotations and the Slater-determinant preparation.** Neither an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") nor the [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") that the leading [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and rotation fuse into (see below) is mapped to qubits as such. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass first breaks them down, in fermionic space, into [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gates on one or two modes each (and, for the preparation, an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference), so any encoding that can map an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") handles them. Under Jordan-Wigner, the factors between adjacent modes become [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects at the qubit stage.\n"
msgstr "**Putaran orbital dan penyediaan penentu Slater.** Tidak [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") mahupun [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") yang digabungkan oleh [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") utama dan putaran (lihat di bawah) dipetakan ke qubit sebagaimana adanya. Pas [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") terlebih dahulu memecahkannya, dalam ruang fermionik, menjadi gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") pada satu atau dua mod setiap satu (dan, untuk penyediaan, sebuah [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") bagi rujukan), jadi mana-mana pengekodan yang boleh memetakan [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") dapat mengendalikannya. Di bawah Jordan-Wigner, faktor antara mod bersebelahan menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)pada peringkat qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The initialization.** The plugin for [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") is not parametrized by an encoding: it documents its assumption of an occupation-basis encoding with a 1-to-1 mode-to-qubit mapping, and emits gates directly on that basis. A different encoding needs its own plugin for it, and none ships yet.\n"
msgstr "**Pemulaan.** Pemalam untuk [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") tidak diparametrikan oleh pengekodan: ia mendokumenkan andaiannya tentang pengekodan asas penghunian dengan pemetaan mod-ke-qubit 1-ke-1, dan mengeluarkan gate terus pada asas itu. Pengekodan yang berbeza memerlukan pemalamnya sendiri, dan belum ada yang disertakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to transpile UCJ circuits under a non-Jordan-Wigner encoding is an open research question and this package provides the framework within which to develop such a pipeline. The remainder of this guide constructs the transpiler pipeline for the Jordan-Wigner encoding, equivalent to the one produced by [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), as an example.\n"
msgstr "Cara mentranspilasikan litar UCJ di bawah pengekodan bukan Jordan-Wigner ialah persoalan penyelidikan terbuka dan pakej ini menyediakan rangka kerja untuk membangunkan saluran paip sedemikian. Baki panduan ini membina saluran paip transpiler untuk pengekodan Jordan-Wigner, setara dengan yang dihasilkan oleh [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), sebagai contoh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"lower-it-through-jordan-wigner\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Lower it through Jordan-Wigner {#4-lower-it-through-jordan-wigner}"
msgstr "4. Turunkan melalui Jordan-Wigner {#4-lower-it-through-jordan-wigner}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lowering happens in [`F2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis\"), which works like Qiskit’s [`HighLevelSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HighLevelSynthesis): it walks the fermionic instructions and hands each to a plugin registered for that gate name. Its [`F2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods\") attribute holds one [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\") per gate name, so building the stage means choosing a plugin for every fermionic gate the circuit contains:\n"
msgstr "Penurunan berlaku dalam [`F2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis\"), yang berfungsi seperti [`HighLevelSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HighLevelSynthesis) Qiskit: ia melalui arahan fermionik dan menyerahkan setiap satu kepada pemalam yang didaftarkan untuk nama gate tersebut. Atribut [`F2QSynthesis.methods`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2QSynthesis.methods\") memegang satu [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\") bagi setiap nama gate, jadi membina peringkat ini bermaksud memilih pemalam untuk setiap gate fermionik yang terkandung dalam litar:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigning instances like this is also how a plugin you wrote yourself enters the pipeline, without having to register it anywhere first.\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan tika seperti ini juga merupakan cara pemalam yang anda tulis sendiri memasuki saluran paip, tanpa perlu mendaftarkannya di mana-mana terlebih dahulu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is where the encoding is settled, in the two ways section 3 described: explicitly, by handing [`jordan_wigner()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/mappers-library-jordan-wigner#qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner \"qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner\") to [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\"), and implicitly, by the other plugin already assuming it.\n"
msgstr "Di sinilah pengekodan ditetapkan, dalam dua cara yang diterangkan dalam bahagian 3: secara eksplisit, dengan menyerahkan [`jordan_wigner()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/mappers-library-jordan-wigner#qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner \"qiskit_fermions.mappers.library.jordan_wigner\") kepada [`MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-mapper-fn-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.MapperFnEvolutionSynthesis\"), dan secara tersirat, oleh pemalam lain yang sudah mengandaikannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "That stage then slots into a [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) whose stages run in a fixed order:\n"
msgstr "Peringkat itu kemudian dimasukkan ke dalam [`MultiStagePassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.passmanager.MultiStagePassManager) yang peringkatnya berjalan dalam urutan tetap:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The **optimization** stage runs *before* synthesis, on the fermionic circuit, which is what makes it worth having: it rewrites gates while they are still fermionic and encoding-agnostic, so the savings carry to whatever encoding follows. [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") collapses each run of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates into one, which matters for a UCJ ansatz because every layer ends with $\\mathcal{U}_k$ and the next begins with $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$. [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") then fuses the leading [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and the rotation that follows it into a single [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), which synthesis lowers through the cheaper reduced Slater decomposition instead of a full square rotation. The order matters: merging the rotations first exposes the single rotation immediately after the initialization, which the Slater fusion then contracts into it. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") comes last, because it breaks up whatever rotation is left, and doing so any earlier would leave the two merging passes with nothing to fuse.\n"
msgstr "Peringkat **pengoptimuman** berjalan *sebelum* sintesis, pada litar fermionik, yang menjadikannya bernilai: ia menulis semula gate semasa masih fermionik dan tidak bergantung pada pengekodan, jadi penjimatan dibawa kepada apa jua pengekodan yang menyusul. [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") meruntuhkan setiap rentetan gate [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") berturutan menjadi satu, yang penting untuk ansatz UCJ kerana setiap lapisan berakhir dengan $\\mathcal{U}_k$ dan yang berikutnya bermula dengan $\\mathcal{U}_{k+1}^\\dagger$. [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") kemudian menggabungkan [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") utama dan putaran yang mengikutinya menjadi satu [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), yang diturunkan oleh sintesis melalui penguraian Slater terturun yang lebih murah dan bukannya putaran segi empat sama penuh. Urutan penting: menggabungkan putaran terlebih dahulu mendedahkan putaran tunggal sejurus selepas pemulaan, yang kemudian dikecutkan ke dalamnya oleh pelakuran Slater. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") datang terakhir, kerana ia memecahkan apa sahaja putaran yang tinggal, dan berbuat demikian lebih awal akan meninggalkan kedua-dua pas penggabungan tanpa apa-apa untuk digabungkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The remaining stages are plumbing. `input` and `output` convert between circuits and DAGs, `layout` assigns fermionic modes to qubits ([`TrivialF2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-trivial-f-2-q-layout#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout\") maps mode `i` to qubit `i`), and `qubit` is an ordinary Qiskit pass manager that takes over once nothing fermionic is left.\n"
msgstr "Peringkat yang tinggal ialah kerja paip. `input` dan `output` menukar antara litar dan DAG, `layout` menetapkan mod fermionik kepada qubit ([`TrivialF2QLayout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-trivial-f-2-q-layout#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.TrivialF2QLayout\") memetakan mod `i` kepada qubit `i`), dan `qubit` ialah pass manager Qiskit biasa yang mengambil alih apabila tiada lagi yang fermionik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running it requires one preparatory step: the composite [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") gate has to be decomposed into its primitive gates first, so the optimization stage can see the individual rotations and evolutions.\n"
msgstr "Menjalankannya memerlukan satu langkah persediaan: gate komposit [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") perlu diuraikan terlebih dahulu kepada gate primitifnya, supaya peringkat pengoptimuman dapat melihat putaran dan evolusi individu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without a target device, this maps onto `2 * norb` qubits with all-to-all connectivity assumed; the orbital rotations synthesize into [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects and the diagonal Coulomb evolutions into [`RZZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate)objects:\n"
msgstr "Tanpa peranti sasaran, ini dipetakan ke `2 * norb` qubit dengan kesambungan semua-ke-semua diandaikan; putaran orbital disintesis menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)dan evolusi Coulomb pepenjuru menjadi objek [`RZZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate):\n"

