#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pipeline is exactly what [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\") assembles, so reach for the preset in practice and build the stages by hand when you need to change one of them:\n"
msgstr "Saluran paip ini tepat seperti yang dihimpunkan oleh [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), jadi gunakan pratetap dalam amalan dan bina peringkat secara manual apabila anda perlu mengubah salah satu daripadanya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"match-the-device-topology\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Match the device topology {#5-match-the-device-topology}"
msgstr "5. Padankan topologi peranti {#5-match-the-device-topology}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A real device has a restricted qubit coupling map, and the LUCJ ansatz is designed to match it. The same-spin (`pairs_aa`) interactions form two linear chains and the alpha-beta (`pairs_ab`) interactions bridge them. ffsim’s [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") builds a device-aware qubit pipeline for this structure, and returns the subset of `pairs_ab` the hardware can actually accommodate. Slot that pipeline into the preset’s `qubit` stage while keeping the package’s own fermion-to-qubit synthesis:\n"
msgstr "Peranti sebenar mempunyai peta gandingan qubit yang terhad, dan ansatz LUCJ direka untuk memadankannya. Interaksi spin sama (`pairs_aa`) membentuk dua rantai linear dan interaksi alfa-beta (`pairs_ab`) menjambatani keduanya. [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") milik ffsim membina saluran paip qubit sedar-peranti untuk struktur ini, dan mengembalikan subset `pairs_ab` yang sebenarnya boleh ditampung oleh perkakasan. Masukkan saluran paip itu ke dalam peringkat `qubit` pratetap sambil mengekalkan sintesis fermion-ke-qubit pakej itu sendiri:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "That composition is the point: the `qubit` stage is device-aware, while the fermion-to-qubit synthesis stage ahead of it stays this package’s own, and so stays replaceable. Replacing the `qubit` stage does drop what the preset registers there, which is the [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") that turns the Givens factors of an orbital rotation into [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects. Pass it on through the `hls_config` as above, or the device’s basis has to be reached without it.\n"
msgstr "Gubahan itulah intinya: peringkat `qubit` sedar-peranti, manakala peringkat sintesis fermion-ke-qubit di hadapannya kekal milik pakej ini sendiri, dan oleh itu kekal boleh diganti. Menggantikan peringkat `qubit` memang menggugurkan apa yang didaftarkan oleh pratetap di sana, iaitu [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") yang menukarkan faktor Givens bagi putaran orbital menjadi objek [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate). Salurkannya melalui `hls_config` seperti di atas, atau asas peranti perlu dicapai tanpanya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `pm.qubit` now set to the device-aware pipeline, running the pass manager lays the circuit out on the backend’s qubits and routes it to the coupling map. For the *unrestricted* ansatz from step 1, whose diagonal Coulomb operator still contains alpha-beta terms the hardware cannot reach directly, the router must insert many `SWAP` gates to bridge them:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `pm.qubit` kini ditetapkan kepada saluran paip sedar-peranti, menjalankan pass manager meletakkan litar pada qubit backend dan menghalakannya ke peta gandingan. Bagi ansatz *tidak terhad* daripada langkah 1, yang operator Coulomb pepenjurunya masih mengandungi sebutan alfa-beta yang tidak dapat dicapai secara langsung oleh perkakasan, penghala mesti menyisipkan banyak gate `SWAP` untuk menjambatani:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Restrict the ansatz to the hardware-implementable interactions**\n"
msgstr "**Hadkan ansatz kepada interaksi yang boleh dilaksanakan oleh perkakasan**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fix is to feed `allowed_pairs_ab` back into the ansatz construction, through the `interaction_pairs` argument of [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), so the diagonal Coulomb operator only contains alpha-beta terms the coupling map can implement directly. The ansatz then matches the device topology and the router barely has to touch it:\n"
msgstr "Penyelesaiannya ialah menyuapkan `allowed_pairs_ab` kembali ke dalam pembinaan ansatz, melalui argumen `interaction_pairs` bagi [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), supaya operator Coulomb pepenjuru hanya mengandungi sebutan alfa-beta yang boleh dilaksanakan secara langsung oleh peta gandingan. Ansatz kemudian memadankan topologi peranti dan penghala hampir tidak perlu menyentuhnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing only the active qubits (`idle_wires=False`) shows the circuit restricted to the two spin chains and the alpha-beta bridge, expressed in the device basis gates. Layout and routing scatter the logical modes across the device’s physical qubits, so pass a `wire_order` taken from the circuit’s final layout ([`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) lists the physical qubit each input qubit ended on, in input-qubit order) to draw the wires back in the original mode order:\n"
msgstr "Melukis hanya qubit aktif (`idle_wires=False`) menunjukkan litar terhad kepada dua rantai spin dan jambatan alfa-beta, dinyatakan dalam gate asas peranti. Reka letak dan penghalaan menyerakkan mod logik merentasi qubit fizikal peranti, jadi hantarkan `wire_order` yang diambil daripada reka letak akhir litar ([`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) menyenaraikan qubit fizikal tempat setiap qubit input berakhir, mengikut urutan qubit input) untuk melukis semula wayar dalam urutan mod asal:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The exact post-layout gate counts and depth depend on the routing/optimization passes and the chosen device, so they are not reproduced here. The key point is the co-design; expressing the ansatz with a nearest-neighbor `pairs_aa` chain and hardware-filtered `pairs_ab` bridges keeps the synthesized circuit close to the device topology, minimizing the routing overhead (inserted `SWAP` gates). See [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") for a related synthesis choice (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), trading two-qubit gate count against routed depth.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Nota\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Bilangan gate dan kedalaman tepat selepas reka letak bergantung pada pas penghalaan/pengoptimuman dan peranti yang dipilih, jadi ia tidak dihasilkan semula di sini. Perkara utamanya ialah reka bentuk bersama; menyatakan ansatz dengan rantai `pairs_aa` jiran terdekat dan jambatan `pairs_ab` yang ditapis mengikut perkakasan mengekalkan litar tersintesis dekat dengan topologi peranti, meminimumkan overhed penghalaan (gate `SWAP` yang disisipkan). Lihat [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") untuk pilihan sintesis berkaitan (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), yang menukar bilangan gate dua-qubit dengan kedalaman terhalakan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

